flowchart LR
  subgraph Actors[使用者]
    Resident[住戶]
    Provider[廠商]
    Admin[管理員]
  end

  subgraph Edge[公開入口]
    Amplify[React SPA on Amplify<br/>AI 對話／我的預約／廠商後台]
    APIGW[API Gateway HTTP API<br/>受限 Amplify CORS]
    Cognito[Cognito User Pool<br/>RESIDENT／PROVIDER／ADMIN 群組]
  end

  subgraph VPC[VPC：2 AZ isolated subnets；無 NAT]
    Flask[Flask Lambda<br/>REST＋demo actor authorization]
    ToolLambda[Gateway Tool Lambda<br/>resident operations]
    Core[Shared Python core<br/>validation／safety／matching／idempotency]
    RDS[(Private RDS PostgreSQL<br/>requests／tasks／messages／artifacts／events)]
    Secrets[Secrets Manager＋KMS]
    Endpoint[AgentCore interface endpoint]
  end

  subgraph Managed[AWS managed services]
    subgraph Runtime[一個 AgentCore Runtime]
      Supervisor[Supervisor<br/>確定性工具式路由]
      Restaurant[餐廳 Agent 契約]
      Product[商品 Agent 契約]
      Housekeeping[家事 Agent 契約]
      Repair[水電 Agent<br/>walking skeleton]
      Community[社區 Agent 契約]
    end
    Gateway[AgentCore Gateway<br/>Lambda target 已建立]
    SFN[Step Functions Standard<br/>目前為 durable boundary]
    KB[Bedrock Knowledge Base<br/>Titan Text Embeddings V2]
    Vector[(S3 Vectors<br/>1024-d COSINE)]
    Nova[Nova 2 Lite<br/>白名單；生成式接線待完成]
  end

  KBS3[(Private S3 KB source<br/>5 docs＋5 metadata)]
  Artifact[(Private S3 artifact bucket)]
  Observe[CloudWatch Logs／request ID]

  Resident --> Amplify
  Provider --> Amplify
  Admin --> Amplify
  Amplify -->|demo actor headers＋REST polling| APIGW
  APIGW --> Flask
  Flask --> Endpoint --> Runtime
  Supervisor --> Restaurant
  Supervisor --> Product
  Supervisor --> Housekeeping
  Supervisor --> Repair
  Supervisor --> Community
  Flask --> Core --> RDS
  Core --> Artifact
  Flask -->|start boundary| SFN
  KBS3 --> KB --> Vector
  Secrets -.credential／encryption.-> Flask
  Secrets -.encryption.-> RDS
  Flask --> Observe

  Cognito -.已建立；SPA／JWT authorizer 待接.-> Amplify
  Runtime -.下一階段 MCP tool call.-> Gateway --> ToolLambda --> Core
  Runtime -.下一階段直接 retrieval.-> KB
  Runtime -.下一階段生成式推理.-> Nova
  SFN -.下一階段 task-token callback worker.-> Runtime

